  "notes": "The main Château de Cheverny in its circa 2010 appearance. Includes the limestone front and rear walls, five roof masses, two large square pavilions and attached front stairs. The separate commons, kennel, gardens, and interiors are outside the model. The south elevation and front roof outlines are constrained by the exact photo. The back windows and concealed roofwork are interpreted from the mapped plan and repeated building proportions."
